---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Case Study: Cross-Channel Advertising Campaign"
  description="A cross-channel advertising campaign that increased brand recall by 38% across Gauteng, South Africa."
  image="/logo.png"
>
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 px-4 md:px-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
      <span class="tag">Advertising</span>
      <span class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-sm">Case Study</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Cross-Channel Campaign: Q4 Visibility Push</h1>
    <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-lg mb-8">A multi-channel advertising campaign that increased brand recall by 38%.</p>

    <div class="w-full aspect-video rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 mb-12">
      <img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/images/10580.jpeg`}" alt="Campaign Demo" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-10">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">The Challenge</h2>
        <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] leading-relaxed">
          A local brand needed to cut through the noise in a crowded Q4 market. Their existing
          advertising was fragmented across channels with no unified message or measurable strategy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Our Approach</h2>
        <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We designed a unified campaign architecture spanning digital, print, and experiential
          channels. Each channel had a consistent visual language but adapted to its specific
          audience behavior and context.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#F5F5F5]"><span class="text-[#DE656D] mt-1">&#10003;</span><span>Audience segmentation using behavioral and cultural data</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#F5F5F5]"><span class="text-[#DE656D] mt-1">&#10003;</span><span>Unified creative direction across digital, print, and OOH</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#F5F5F5]"><span class="text-[#DE656D] mt-1">&#10003;</span><span>Real-time optimization using performance data</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">The Results</h2>
        <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] leading-relaxed mb-6">
          The campaign achieved 38% higher brand recall than previous efforts and a 22% increase
          in qualified leads across all channels.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-[#1A1A1A] rounded-xl p-5 border border-white/5 text-center">
            <p class="text-[#DE656D] font-bold text-3xl">+38%</p>
            <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-sm">Brand Recall</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#1A1A1A] rounded-xl p-5 border border-white/5 text-center">
            <p class="text-[#DE656D] font-bold text-3xl">+22%</p>
            <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-sm">Qualified Leads</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#1A1A1A] rounded-xl p-5 border border-white/5 text-center">
            <p class="text-[#DE656D] font-bold text-3xl">500K+</p>
            <p class="text-[#A0A0A0] text-sm">Total Reach</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">Start Your Campaign</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>